/Title (Before Maven, adding a library meant: download the .jar file manually, figure out what other .jar files that library itself needs, download those too, put them all in the right folder, and add them to your build script. One library might need five others, each of which needs three more. This was called "JAR hell.")
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1099 0 R
/Prev 1103 0 R
/Next 1110 0 R
>>
endobj
